# meta::summary1 = (human1) After finding out she is pregnant, a vlogger who is now seven weeks pregnant and due in mid-September tells about her feelings, her decision to document her pregnancy on her vlog, her diet and cravings, getting doctor's and midwife appointments and experiencing nausea and headaches.
# meta::summary2 = (claude-3-5-sonnet-20241022) A woman shares her early pregnancy journey at 7 weeks, describing her initial anxiety and shock upon finding out, current symptoms like loss of appetite and headaches, and her decision to document the experience while expecting a baby in mid-September.
# meta::summary3 = (gpt4o; postedited) A woman discovers her pregnancy, feeling anxious and overwhelmed about the life change as she tracks her symptoms and dietary shifts, choosing to document her journey through videos to process and share the experience after initially being daunted by others' pregnancy stories and holding off telling others until she feels more settled.
# meta::summary4 = (Llama-3.2-3B-Instruct; postedited) The speaker has just found out she is pregnant and is documenting her first trimester on YouTube, sharing her anxiety, struggles with appetite, and physical symptoms such as nausea and headaches, as well as her efforts to stay healthy and prepare for motherhood.
# meta::summary5 = (Qwen2.5-7B-Instruct) A young woman shares her experience of finding out she's pregnant, initially feeling anxious and overwhelmed, but now ready to document her journey through the first trimester.
